{"id":"ralph-873.1","title":"Script foundation: header, config, utilities, arg parsing, prereqs, early-exit","description":"Create ralph script with sections 1-6: shebang + strict mode, default configuration (MAX_TASKS, MAX_LOOPS, TIMEOUT_MINUTES, SCOPE, STATE_FILE), utility functions (log, load_state, save_state), argument parsing (--dry-run, --max-tasks, --max-loops, --timeout, --scope, --status, --reset, --help), prerequisite checks (jq, bd, claude, gtimeout/timeout, .beads/), and early-exit handlers (--status prints state, --reset clears state). ~90 lines.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"jeremiah@jeremiahsmith.dev","created_at":"2026-02-04T09:54:08.321311Z","created_by":"Jeremiah Smith","updated_at":"2026-02-04T10:54:14.390499Z","closed_at":"2026-02-04T10:54:14.390499Z","close_reason":"Closed","source_repo":".","compaction_level":0,"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"ralph-873.1","depends_on_id":"ralph-873","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-02-04T09:54:08.322334Z","created_by":"Jeremiah Smith","metadata":"","thread_id":""}]}
{"id":"ralph-873.2","title":"Task selection: pick_next_task and get_task_details functions","description":"Implement pick_next_task() — runs bd ready --json --limit 20, uses jq to skip epics (issue_type != epic), applies --scope pattern via jq test(), returns first match ID. Implement get_task_details() — runs bd show ID --json, extracts .issue.title, .issue.description, .issue.notes, .issue.acceptance_criteria, .issue.design with jq. ~35 lines.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"jeremiah@jeremiahsmith.dev","created_at":"2026-02-04T09:54:10.740942Z","created_by":"Jeremiah Smith","updated_at":"2026-02-04T10:54:14.406921Z","closed_at":"2026-02-04T10:54:14.406921Z","close_reason":"Closed","source_repo":".","compaction_level":0,"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"ralph-873.2","depends_on_id":"ralph-873","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-02-04T09:54:10.741625Z","created_by":"Jeremiah Smith","metadata":"","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"ralph-873.2","depends_on_id":"ralph-873.1","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-02-04T09:55:49.407561Z","created_by":"Jeremiah Smith","metadata":"","thread_id":""}]}
{"id":"ralph-873.3","title":"Main loop: Claude invocation, response parsing, circuit breaker, task outcomes","description":"Implement the core outer loop: exit condition checks (max_tasks, max_loops, circuit OPEN), task picking with current_task retry for EXIT_SIGNAL=false, claim via bd update --status in_progress, prompt construction from template + task details, Claude invocation with timeout (claude -p PROMPT --output-format json --max-turns 50 --verbose), response parsing (extract .result with jq, extract RALPH_STATUS block, parse STATUS/FILES_MODIFIED/EXIT_SIGNAL/SUMMARY), circuit breaker state machine (CLOSED->HALF_OPEN at no_progress>=2, HALF_OPEN->OPEN at no_progress>=3, recovery on progress), and task outcome handling (COMPLETE: bd close + bd set-state verified=needs-review, BLOCKED: release claim, EXIT_SIGNAL false: retry same task). ~100 lines.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"jeremiah@jeremiahsmith.dev","created_at":"2026-02-04T09:54:15.787149Z","created_by":"Jeremiah Smith","updated_at":"2026-02-04T10:54:14.421797Z","closed_at":"2026-02-04T10:54:14.421797Z","close_reason":"Closed","source_repo":".","compaction_level":0,"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"ralph-873.3","depends_on_id":"ralph-873","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-02-04T09:54:15.787953Z","created_by":"Jeremiah Smith","metadata":"","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"ralph-873.3","depends_on_id":"ralph-873.2","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-02-04T09:55:49.476709Z","created_by":"Jeremiah Smith","metadata":"","thread_id":""}]}
